    "final_answer": "I have found the answer. Here are the results:\n\n## Pickup Availability for Smart Folio for iPad near ZIP code 90038\n\nThe closest Apple Store for pickup of the **Smart Folio for iPad (A16)** near zip code 90038 is:\n\n### 🥇 Apple The Grove — 2.08 miles away\n- **Address:** 189 The Grove Drive, Los Angeles, CA 90036\n- **Phone:** 323-617-9800\n- **Availability:** ✅ **Available Today** for In-Store Pickup\n- **Hours:**\n  - Mon–Thu: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM\n  - Fri–Sat: 10:00 AM – 10:00 PM\n  - Sun: 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM\n\n### Other nearby stores (all Available Today for In-Store Pickup):\n| Store | Distance |\n|---|---|\n| Apple Beverly Center, Los Angeles | 3.0 mi |\n| Apple Tower Theatre, Los Angeles | 5.21 mi |\n| Apple Glendale Galleria, Glendale | 5.57 mi |\n| Apple Century City, Los Angeles | 5.57 mi |\n| Apple The Americana at Brand, Glendale | 5.59 mi |\n| Apple Sherman Oaks, Sherman Oaks | 7.93 mi |\n| Apple Pasadena, Pasadena | 10.82 mi |\n| Apple Third Street Promenade, Santa Monica | 10.86 mi |\n\nThe **Smart Folio for iPad (A16) – Sky** is currently in stock for In-Store Pickup today at all 9 nearby Apple Stores, with **Apple The Grove** being the closest at just 2.08 miles from zip 90038.\n\nNote: I checked availability for the \"Smart Folio for iPad (A16) – Sky\" model since the search returned six variants and this is the most generic Smart Folio. Other variants (e.g., for iPad Air, iPad Pro) are also generally listed as available at these nearby stores.",
